  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1605.02 Qualifications.\n\n(a) An applicant for a user's, storage, or seller's license shall:\n\n(1) Be 21 years of age or older;\n\n(2) Comply with the application procedures set forth in section Saf-C 1605.03; and\n\n(3) Demonstrate familiarity with these rules.\n\n(b) In addition to the requirements in (a) above, an applicant for a storage license, prior to making application for a storage license, shall:\n\n(1) Comply with the magazine construction and inspection requirements set forth in Parts Saf-C 1609 through Saf-C 1614; and\n\n(2) Have his or her storage facilities inspected and approved.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; amd by #5429, eff 6-25-92; amd by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
